">{{note}}</p>\n</section>\n<div class=\"visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"halo\"></div><div class=\"orbit\"></div><span class=\"pill\">TEMPORARILY OFFLINE</span><span class=\"code\">{{status}}</span><span class=\"visual-label\">{{upperLabel}}</span></div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><span>{{footerLabel}}</span><span>HTTP {{status}} / {{upperLabel}}</span></footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "1-1": "\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\">\n<title>{{title}} | TUTI</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:dark;--ink:#f0f5f5;--muted:#a2b4bd;--mint:#a5f3d0;--line:#ffffff18}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#09141d;color:var(--ink);font-family:\"Yu Gothic UI\",\"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\",system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.8;min-height:100svh;overflow-x:hidden}\nbody:before{content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 82% 40%,#194e533d,transparent 52%),linear-gradient(115deg,#ffffff03,transparent 60%)}\n.shell{width:100%;max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding:38px 56px 26px;position:relative}.header,.brand,.state,.footer{display:flex;align-items:center}.header{justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.brand{gap:12px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:16px}.brand-icon{width:31px;height:31px;border:1px solid #a5f3d060;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--mint)}.brand-icon svg{width:18px;height:18px}.state{gap:9px;color:#d2ddd9;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.05em}.dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--mint);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 18px #a5f3d040}\nmain{min-height:calc(100svh - 183px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:48px;padding:70px 0 80px}.eyebrow{color:var(--mint);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;margin:0 0 24px;font-weight:650}.eyebrow:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:27px;height:1px;background:var(--mint);vertical-align:middle;margin-right:12px}h1{text-wrap:balance;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.025em;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 25px}.intro{font-size:14px;line-height:2.1;color:var(--muted);max-width:430px;margin:0}.retry{margin:30px 0 26px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:17px 20px;background:#ffffff03;max-width:420px;display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:flex-start}.retry svg{width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--mint);flex:none;margin-top:4px}.retry strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:550}.retry p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:3px 0 0;line-height:1.9}.refresh{display:inline-flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:var(--mint);color:#102b25;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 22px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,transform .15s}.refresh:hover{background:#c0f9e1;transform:translateY(-1px)}.refresh:focus-visible{outline:3px solid white;outline-offset:5px}.refresh svg{width:17px;height:17px}.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-top:14px}\n.visual{position:relative;min-height:410px;display:grid;place-items:center;isolation:isolate}.orbit{position:absolute;width:350px;aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid #a5f3d01c;border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-25deg)}.orbit:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:28px;border:1px dashed #a5f3d019;border-radius:50%}.orbit:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);left:48px;top:47px;box-shadow:0 0 24px #a5f3d066}.halo{position:absolute;width:270px;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#a5f3d00c,transparent 70%);z-index:-1}.code{font-size:clamp(110px,15vw,186px);font-weight:250;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.065em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#c8e7df;transform:translateX(-6px)}.visual-label{position:absolute;bottom:22px;color:#779d9a;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.28em}.pill{position:absolute;top:48px;right:0;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#a5f3d0a0;border:1px solid #a5f3d025;border-radius:30px;padding:5px 11px;background:#0c1c23}.footer{justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px;color:#738b98;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.05em}.footer span:last-child{letter-spacing:.14em}\n@media(min-width:1500px){.shell{padding-top:55px}main{min-height:calc(100svh - 225px)}}\n@media(max-width:760px){.shell{padding:23px 25px}.header{gap:12px}.brand{font-size:14px}.state{font-size:10px}main{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:5px;min-height:auto;padding:34px 0 38px}.visual{grid-row:1;min-height:230px}.orbit{width:215px}.orbit:before{inset:19px}.orbit:after{left:27px;top:29px}.code{font-size:115px}.pill{right:10px;top:14px;font-size:8px}.visual-label{bottom:7px;font-size:8px}.eyebrow{margin:24px 0 18px;font-size:10px}h1{text-wrap:balance;font-size:30px;line-height:1.65}.intro{font-size:13px}.retry{margin:24px 0;max-width:none}.refresh{width:100%;justify-content:center}.note{text-align:center}.footer{font-size:9px;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.refresh{transition:none}.refresh:hover{transform:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"shell\">\n<header class=\"header\"><div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"brand-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M5 6h14M12 6v13M8 10h8\"/></svg></span>TUTI</div><div class=\"state\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>{{stateLabel}}</div></header>\n<main>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">SERVICE MAINTENANCE</p>\n<h1 id=\"title\">より良いサービスのために、<br>少しだけ、お時間を。</h1>\n<p class=\"intro\">ただいまメンテナンス中です。<br>サービスの保守作業に伴い、一時的にご利用を<br class=\"desktop-break\">お待ちいただいています。</p>\n<div class=\"retry\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg><div><strong>5分ほど経ってから、もう一度お試しください</strong><p>再試行までの目安です。作業状況により、<br>サービスの再開までお時間をいただく場合があります。</p></div></div>\n<button class=\"refresh\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"window.location.reload()\">ページを再読み込み<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"><path d=\"M20 7v5h-5M4 17v-5h5\"/><path d=\"M6 7a7 7 0 0 1 12-1l2 6M4 12l2 6a7 7 0 0 0 12-1\"/></svg></button><p class=\"note\">{{note}}</p>\n</section>\n<div class=\"visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"halo\"></div><div class=\"orbit\"></div><span class=\"pill\">TEMPORARILY OFFLINE</span><span class=\"code\">{{status}}</span><span class=\"visual-label\">{{upperLabel}}</span></div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><span>{{footerLabel}}</span><span>HTTP {{status}} / {{upperLabel}}</span></footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
